---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About - Paul Ann Media"
  description="Websites, local search and social for owners who do the work."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">About</h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate">
      Paul Ann Media helps owners who do the work get their name out there. We build websites, set up local search, and run the posts and campaigns that bring customers in ... for clients, and for the products we own outright.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-bold">How we think</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">
      We start with what you already have ... your work, your reputation, your customers ... and make it easy to find. Then we measure what&#39;s working and tell you plainly, including when marketing isn&#39;t the answer.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-bold">The family</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">
      Paul Ann Media sits under <strong class="text-navy">Trimmie Holdings</strong>, alongside
      <strong class="text-navy">Paul Ann Labs</strong>. Media handles demand ... audience, brand,
      pipeline. Labs handles operations ... AI deployed inside the business itself. Most clients
      need one before the other, and we're clear about which.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">
      The names come from a family. Trimmie from two first names, Paul Ann from the middle ones.
      It seemed like the right way to sign work you intend to stand behind.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-bold">How we work</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate">
      <li><strong class="text-navy">Start small.</strong> One engagement, proven, before anything bigger.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-navy">No marked-up media.</strong> You pay platforms directly. Our fee is our fee.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-navy">Build systems, not campaigns.</strong> The goal is something that keeps working after we leave.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-navy">Say no.</strong> If marketing isn't your bottleneck, we'll tell you what is.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Start a conversation</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate">
        Tell us what you're trying to grow.
      </p>
      <a href="/#contact"
         class="mt-5 inline-block rounded bg-teal px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-teal-light transition-colors">
        Send us a note
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
